              <td style="padding:28px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;">
      <h2 style="color: #0891b2;">Booking confirmation</h2>
      <p>Hello Camille Martin,</p>
      <p style="line-height:1.6;">Your payment has been received and your consultation with Dr Ahmed Ben Lallahom is confirmed. Your invoice is sent to you in a separate email.</p>
      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0;">
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
          <li style="padding: 4px 0;"><strong>Reference:</strong> APTSNAPSHOT01</li>
          <li style="padding: 4px 0;"><strong>Date and time:</strong> Friday, 20 November 2026 at 10:00 (Paris time)</li>
          <li style="padding: 4px 0;"><strong>Duration:</strong> 30 minutes</li>
          <li style="padding: 4px 0;"><strong>Amount paid:</strong> €100.00</li>
          <li style="padding: 4px 0;"><strong>Video call link:</strong> <a href="https://drahmedbenlallahom.com/visio/exemple">https://drahmedbenlallahom.com/visio/exemple</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p style="line-height:1.6;">Add to my calendar: open the attached file “consultation-APTSNAPSHOT01.ics” (Google Calendar, Outlook, Apple Calendar…).</p>
      <p style="line-height:1.6;">Keep your reference: you will be asked for it with any question. This scheduled consultation does not replace emergency care: in an emergency, call the emergency services.</p>
      
      <p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#475569;">Cancellation: full refund if you cancel more than 24 hours before the appointment; after that, the booking cannot be refunded. To cancel, contact us quoting your reference.</p>
      <p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#475569;">A question, a change or a cancellation? Write to us at <a href="mailto:executive.office@drahmedbenlallahom.com">executive.office@drahmedbenlallahom.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+33972152413">+33 9 72 15 24 13</a>, quoting your reference. You can also reply directly to this email.</p>
