  "subject": "Booking confirmation - APTSNAPSHOT01",
  "text": "Booking confirmation

Hello Camille Martin,

Your payment has been received and your consultation with Dr Ahmed Ben Lallahom is confirmed. Your invoice is sent to you in a separate email.

Reference: APTSNAPSHOT01
Date and time: Friday, 20 November 2026 at 10:00 (Paris time)
Duration: 30 minutes
Amount paid: €100.00
Video call link: https://drahmedbenlallahom.com/visio/exemple

Add to my calendar: open the attached file “consultation-APTSNAPSHOT01.ics” (Google Calendar, Outlook, Apple Calendar…).

Keep your reference: you will be asked for it with any question. This scheduled consultation does not replace emergency care: in an emergency, call the emergency services.

Cancellation: full refund if you cancel more than 24 hours before the appointment; after that, the booking cannot be refunded. To cancel, contact us quoting your reference.

A question, a change or a cancellation? Write to us at executive.office@drahmedbenlallahom.com or call +33 9 72 15 24 13, quoting your reference. You can also reply directly to this email.

Dr Ahmed Ben Lallahom

[pièce jointe] consultation-APTSNAPSHOT01.ics (text/calendar; charset=utf-8; method=PUBLISH)",
}
`;

