        <h2 style="color:#0891b2;">Create your candidate portal</h2>
        <p>Hello Camille,</p>
        <p>Our team invites you to create your secure candidate portal to upload and track your administrative documents. After confirming your details, you will receive a link to activate your email address and choose your password.</p>
        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0;border-collapse:separate;"><tr><td bgcolor="#0e7490" style="padding:12px 18px;border-radius:7px;background:#0e7490;"><a href="https://drahmedbenlallahom.com/candidate/access?invite=exemple&amp;lang=en" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;">Create my candidate portal</a></td></tr></table>
        <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;">This secure, personal link gives no access until your email address is activated and your password chosen. This invitation link is valid for 7 days. After that, you can still create your portal from the “Candidate portal” page of the website, with the same email address.</p>
        <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;">This email is sent by Hippocampus Consulting from recrutement@drahmedbenlallahom.com. If you cannot find this email, check your Spam or Junk folder, then add this address to your contacts.</p>
    </td>
            </tr>
