              <td style="padding:18px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#64748b;">Hippocampus Consulting<br />Professional and confidential communication<br /><a href="https://drahmedbenlallahom.com/?lang=en" style="color:#0e7490;">Website</a> · <a href="https://drahmedbenlallahom.com/legal?tab=privacy&amp;lang=en" style="color:#0e7490;">Privacy policy</a></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
