  "subject": "Create your candidate portal — Hippocampus Consulting",
  "text": "Create your candidate portal

Hello Camille,

Our team invites you to create your secure candidate portal to upload and track your administrative documents. After confirming your details, you will receive a link to activate your email address and choose your password.

https://drahmedbenlallahom.com/candidate/access?invite=exemple&lang=en

This secure, personal link gives no access until your email address is activated and your password chosen. This invitation link is valid for 7 days. After that, you can still create your portal from the “Candidate portal” page of the website, with the same email address.

This email is sent by Hippocampus Consulting from recrutement@drahmedbenlallahom.com. If you cannot find this email, check your Spam or Junk folder, then add this address to your contacts.",
}
`;

